            "info_text_individual": "Up to 25% off custom orders! It depends on the set you choose — see the details here.",
            "info_html": "<h2>How does the discount work?</h2> <p>The discount is applied automatically at checkout, but only for sets from €60 upwards.</p> <h3>Discount table:</h3> <table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\"> <thead> <tr> <th>Order value</th> <th>Set type</th> <th>Discount</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>from €60 to €219</td> <td> – Carvion without edges: FRONT, FRONT+REAR, FRONT+REAR+TRUNK<br> – Carvion 3D with edges: FRONT </td> <td>-20%</td> </tr> <tr> <td>from €220 <br>\nand up</td> <td> – Carvion 3D with edges: FRONT+REAR, FRONT+REAR+TRUNK<br> – Sets for VANS, BUSES, MINIVANS </td> <td>-25%</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h3>Examples:</h3> <ul> <li>Without edges FRONT+REAR+TRUNK (141.74 €) → discount <strong>-20%</strong>\n</li> <li>With edges FRONT+REAR (225.33 €) → discount <strong>-25%</strong>\n</li> </ul> <p><strong>You don't have to do anything — the discount appears automatically in the cart!</strong></p>",
            "info_html_individual": "<h2>How does the discount work?</h2>\n<p>The discount is applied automatically when you submit a custom order, but only for orders from €44 upwards.</p>\n\n<h3>Discount table:</h3>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n   <thead>\n      <tr>\n         <th>Order value</th>\n         <th>Set type</th>\n         <th>Discount</th>\n      </tr>\n   </thead>\n   <tbody>\n      <tr>\n         <td>from €44 to €219</td>\n         <td>\n         – Custom Carvion sets without edges: FRONT, FRONT+REAR, FRONT+REAR+TRUNK<br>\n         – Custom Carvion 3D sets with edges: FRONT\n         </td>\n         <td>-20%</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n         <td>from €220 and up</td>\n         <td>\n         – Custom Carvion 3D sets with edges: FRONT+REAR, FRONT+REAR+TRUNK<br>\n         – Custom sets for VANS, BUSES, MINIVANS\n         </td>\n         <td>-25%</td>\n      </tr>\n   </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3>Examples:</h3>\n<ul>\n   <li>Custom set without edges FRONT+REAR+TRUNK (141.74 €) → discount <strong>-20%</strong>\n</li>\n   <li>Custom set with edges FRONT+REAR (225.33 €) → discount <strong>-25%</strong>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>The discount is applied automatically once the custom car-mat order is submitted.<br></strong> After you submit the order our consultant will contact you, confirm the details, give the final price and answer any questions about the discount.</p>",
            "individual_welcome_html": "<p><strong>How does a custom order work?</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Configure your set: enter the vehicle details, choose colours and accessories.</li>\n<li>Pay a deposit: up front you pay only a small deposit (plus any accessories in full).</li>\n<li>Confirm the details: our consultant will call you, confirm everything and pass the order to production.</li>\n<li>Pay the balance: settle the remaining amount by bank transfer in advance or cash on delivery.</li>\n</ol>",
            "auto_open_individual_welcome_popup": true
          }
